      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.29,
          "end": 8.43,
          "en": "To add the validation logic, I'll add a new folder here in the source folder, which I'll name helpers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.44,
          "end": 10.75,
          "en": "You could also name it shared or whatever you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.75,
          "end": 16.33,
          "en": "And in there I'll add a new JavaScript file validation dot JS And the idea of that file is simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 16.33,
          "end": 21.67,
          "en": "It should expose a couple of functions that help with validation so that we could share it across the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 21.67,
          "end": 23.01,
          "en": "entire application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 23.02,
          "end": 28.48,
          "en": "Of course, if the only component where you have validation is the added meetup component, then you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 28.48,
          "end": 30.34,
          "en": "could define all the functions in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 30.34,
          "end": 36.34,
          "en": "But to keep that component lean and again, to have the possibility of sharing it across the application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 36.34,
          "end": 39.79,
          "en": "I'll define my validation logic here in the separate file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 40.12,
          "end": 48.49,
          "en": "So in here I'll export a function and I'll name the first one is not empty or just not empty, whatever",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 48.49,
          "end": 49.12,
          "en": "you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 51.49,
          "end": 55.63,
          "en": "It accepts a value and it will simply return Val.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 55.66,
          "end": 62.05,
          "en": "Trim to remove excess whitespace length and then checks if it's greater than zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 63.91,
          "end": 68.05,
          "en": "Or the opposite is empty if it is equal to zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 68.23,
          "end": 75.7,
          "en": "So this will return true if the input, the value here has no characters or only whitespace characters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 75.7,
          "end": 77.86,
          "en": "which essentially is also an empty value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 78.19,
          "end": 80.89,
          "en": "This is the first validation function I want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 80.92,
          "end": 83.89,
          "en": "And now in edit meetup we can import this function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 83.98,
          "end": 85.84,
          "en": "So we can import.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 86.51,
          "end": 87.59,
          "en": "From.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 90.05,
          "end": 92.42,
          "en": "Helpers validation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 92.42,
          "end": 95.47999999999999,
          "en": "And there I named it is empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 95.66,
          "end": 97.34,
          "en": "So is empty is my function here.",
